      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1297740590,
      "text": "Chorispora tenella is a species of flowering plant in the mustard family known by several common names, including purple mustard, blue mustard, musk mustard, and crossflower. This mustard is native to parts of Eurasia but is well known in other parts of the world, particularly in temperate regions, as an introduced species and a noxious weed."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Chorispora tenella",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chorispora_tenella",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 175302605,
      "text": "Chorispora tenella es una especie de planta de la familia Brassicaceae. Es nativa de Eurasia, pero es bien conocida en otras partes del mundo, especialmente en las regiones templadas, como especie introducida y una maleza nociva."
    },
    "fr": {
